   "resumo_en": "8-Way Santa is the second album by the Seattle grunge band Tad. It was released on February 15, 1991, through Sub Pop.\nTad ran into legal trouble after the man and woman featured on the album cover saw the record and sued the band. The cover was an altered photo, the original of which was found in a photo album purchased from a thrift store.\nRolling Stone ranked this album 31st on their list of the 50 Greatest Grunge Albums.",
